  "extract_html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div class=\"ib-wrap\" style=\"width:400px\">\n   \n<aside role=\"region\" class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-black pi-layout-default\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"Box title\">Bodily Fluid Absorption</h2>\n\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\" data-source=\"image\">\n\t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/7/76/Imhotep_Feeds.gif/revision/latest?cb=20180531223949\" class=\"image image-thumbnail\" title=\"Imhotep Feeds\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/7/76/Imhotep_Feeds.gif/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/350?cb=20180531223949\" srcset=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/7/76/Imhotep_Feeds.gif/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/350?cb=20180531223949 1x, https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/7/76/Imhotep_Feeds.gif/revision/latest?cb=20180531223949 2x\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" data-relevant=\"1\" alt=\"Imhotep Feeds\" width=\"270\" height=\"115\" data-image-key=\"Imhotep_Feeds.gif\" data-image-name=\"Imhotep Feeds.gif\" />\n\t\t\n\t</a>\n\t\n</figure>\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">According to his curse, Imhotep (The Mummy) must absorbed the organic substance and fluids of those who open his chest to regenerate himself whole.</h2>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Row 1 info\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Power/Ability to:</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Absorb bodily fluids.</div>\n</div>\n</aside>\n</div><p> The power to <b>absorb bodily fluids</b>. Sub-power of <a href=\"/wiki/Bodily_Fluid_Manipulation\" title=\"Bodily Fluid Manipulation\">Bodily Fluid Manipulation</a>. Variation of <a href=\"/wiki/Organic_Consumption\" title=\"Organic Consumption\">Organic Consumption</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/Metabolization\" title=\"Metabolization\">Metabolization</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/Life-Force_Absorption\" title=\"Life-Force Absorption\">Life-Force Absorption</a>.\n</p><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Also_Called\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Also Called</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Capabilities\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Capabilities</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Applications\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Applications</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Variation\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Variation</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Associations\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Associations</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#Limitations\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Limitations</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-7\"><a href=\"#Known_Users\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">7</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Known Users</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-8\"><a href=\"#Gallery\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">8</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Gallery</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-9\"><a href=\"#Videos\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">9</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Videos</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Also_Called\">Also Called</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FBodily_Fluid_Absorption%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D1&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li>Bodily Fluid Draining/Consumption/Ingestion/Sucking/Sustenance</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Capabilities\">Capabilities</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FBodily_Fluid_Absorption%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D2&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The user can absorb (usually by directly absorbing or simply ingesting) the bodily fluids of others for either sustenance, offensive, defensive, or regenerative purposes.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Applications\">Applications</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FBodily_Fluid_Absorption%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D3&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Metabolization\" title=\"Metabolization\">Metabolization</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Perpetual_Nourishment\" title=\"Perpetual Nourishment\">Perpetual Nourishment</a></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Variation\">Variation</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FBodily_Fluid_Absorption%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D4&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Blood_Consumption\" title=\"Blood Consumption\">Blood Consumption</a>/<a href=\"/wiki/Blood_Absorption\" title=\"Blood Absorption\">Absorption</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Milk_Consumption\" title=\"Milk Consumption\">Milk Consumption</a></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Associations\">Associations</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FBodily_Fluid_Absorption%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D5&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Trait:Affinity\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Trait:Affinity\">Affinity</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Dependency\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Dependency\">Dependency</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Elemental_Absorption\" title=\"Elemental Absorption\">Elemental Absorption</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Life-Force_Absorption\" title=\"Life-Force Absorption\">Life-Force Absorption</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Organic_Consumption\" title=\"Organic Consumption\">Organic Consumption</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Succubus_Physiology\" title=\"Succubus Physiology\">Succubus Physiology</a></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Limitations\">Limitations</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FBodily_Fluid_Absorption%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D6&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li>May need to continually ingest/absorb bodily fluids to survive.</li>\n<li>If target's bodily fluid contains something the user is vulnerable, they are essentially ingesting/metabolizing it directly.</li>\n<li>Does not work on anything that does <a href=\"/wiki/Bodily_Fluid_Independence\" title=\"Bodily Fluid Independence\">not have bodily fluids</a>, such as most <a href=\"/wiki/Bionic_Physiology\" title=\"Bionic Physiology\">robots or machines</a>.</li>\n<li>Depending on the <a href=\"/wiki/Supernatural_Fluids\" title=\"Supernatural Fluids\">fluids properties</a>, absorbing/consuming/drinking its could be beneficial or lethal.\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Poisonous_Bodily_Fluids\" title=\"Poisonous Bodily Fluids\">Poisonous Bodily Fluids</a>, unless users must have <a href=\"/wiki/Poison_Immunity\" title=\"Poison Immunity\">Poison Immunity</a>.</li></ul></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Known_Users\">Known Users</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FBodily_Fluid_Absorption%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D7&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"https://kinnikuman.fandom.com/wiki/Mister_Khamen%23Techniques\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:c:kinnikuman:Mister Khamen\">Mister Khamen</a> (<i>Kinnikuman</i>); via Cartouche Straw</li>\n<li>SCP-166 - Teenage Succubus (<i>SCP Foundation</i>)</li>\n<li>Carnage (<i>Ultimate Marvel</i>)</li>\n<li>Magus performing a mana transfer (<i>Nasuverse</i>)</li>\n<li>Imhotep (<i>The Mummy</i>)</li>\n<li>Yuki-onnas (<i>Yuki no Niiduma wa Boku to Tokeaitai</i>)\n<ul><li>Ginka</li></ul></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Gallery\">Gallery</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FBodily_Fluid_Absorption%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D8&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<div id=\"gallery-0\" hash=\"503319dcc8b4fe2440113d365ad22de0\" data-seq-no=\"0\" class=\"wikia-gallery wikia-gallery-caption-below wikia-gallery-position-left wikia-gallery-spacing-medium wikia-gallery-border-small wikia-gallery-captions-left wikia-gallery-caption-size-medium\"><div class=\"wikia-gallery-caption\"></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\" style=\"width:197px; \"><div class=\"thumb\" style=\"height:197px;\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\" id=\"Ultimate_Marvel_Carnage_Bodily_Fluid_Absorption-jpg\" style=\"position: relative; height:194px; width:126px; top:0.5px;\"><a class=\"image lightbox\" href=\"/wiki/File:Ultimate_Marvel_Carnage_Bodily_Fluid_Absorption.jpg\" title=\"Ultimate Marvel Carnage Bodily Fluid Absorption.jpg (534 KB)\" style=\"height:194px; width:126px;\"><noscript><img style=\"\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/f/f8/Ultimate_Marvel_Carnage_Bodily_Fluid_Absorption.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/127?cb=20190803234105\" title=\"Ultimate Marvel Carnage Bodily Fluid Absorption.jpg (534 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage\" alt=\"Because of its damaged DNA, Carnage (Ultimate Marvel) can use its tentacles to drain a target&#039;s bodily fluids, to the point of physical death.\" height=\"195\" width=\"195\" data-image-name=\"Ultimate Marvel Carnage Bodily Fluid Absorption.jpg\" data-image-key=\"Ultimate_Marvel_Carnage_Bodily_Fluid_Absorption.jpg\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-caption=\"Because of , Carnage (Ultimate Marvel) can use its tentacles to drain a target&#039;s bodily fluids, to the point of physical death.\"></noscript><img style=\"\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" title=\"Ultimate Marvel Carnage Bodily Fluid Absorption.jpg (534 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" alt=\"Because of its damaged DNA, Carnage (Ultimate Marvel) can use its tentacles to drain a target&#39;s bodily fluids, to the point of physical death.\" height=\"195\" width=\"195\" data-image-name=\"Ultimate Marvel Carnage Bodily Fluid Absorption.jpg\" data-image-key=\"Ultimate_Marvel_Carnage_Bodily_Fluid_Absorption.jpg\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-caption=\"Because of , Carnage (Ultimate Marvel) can use its tentacles to drain a target&#39;s bodily fluids, to the point of physical death.\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/f/f8/Ultimate_Marvel_Carnage_Bodily_Fluid_Absorption.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/127?cb=20190803234105\" /></a></div></div><div class=\"lightbox-caption\" style=\"width:195px;\">Because of <a href=\"/wiki/Dependency\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Dependency\">its damaged DNA</a>, Carnage (Ultimate Marvel) can use its tentacles to drain a target's bodily fluids, to the point of physical death.</div></div></div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Videos\">Videos</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\"